<br>

# Welcome!

This professional learning module prepares you to teach a **Unit 6: Web Apps with AI Capstone Project** where students synthesize their learning to design and build a complete web app with a clear purpose and audience. 

They integrate technical fluency, human-centered design, and AI literacy, making choices that are transparent, ethical, and aligned with their values. 




___

<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; width: 95%; margin: 20pt auto; padding: 0 5px;">
  <img src="https://images.code.org/36211eedb3698751fa5523b4dde93351-image-1760467094025.png" style="border-radius: 5pt; width: 32%;">
  <img src="https://images.code.org/7f813b0aec7d472e470f94eb91471aa1-image-1760466945803.png" style="border-radius: 5pt; width: 32%;">
  <img src="https://images.code.org/ddb463a06ccc88f5d7390a1f841a0f31-image-1760467013014.png" style="border-radius: 5pt; width: 32%;">
</div>

___


**By the end of this professional learning module, you will be able to:**

* Explain the process-oriented approach, emphasizing iteration, testing, and intentional decision-making over just adding features
* Use project tools like the Kanban Board and Project Guide to manage workflow, scope, and team roles
* Facilitate daily spot-checks to monitor progress, prompt reflection, and keep teams aligned
* Assess and celebrate student growth based on process, reasoning, and iteration, not just the final product





